Public Sector Information Notice:
This tool crawls and indexes publicly accessible governance documents published by NHS Trusts and Integrated Care Boards (ICBs). Such public sector information is Crown copyright and made available under the UK Open Government Licence v3.0 (OGL v3.0). This repository provides indexing tools only and does not claim copyright over indexed NHS documents.
